  "details": "After the new update, when I join a world with a lot of people in it my PC immediately crashes. Before the update I would join a world with a lot of people, I would lag for a few minutes, then I would be fine. Now it is so laggy it is unresponsive and then I crash. I have the log files but I cannot attach them to this post\n\nThings I have tried\n\n- Restarting PC\n\n- Updating AMD drivers\n\n- Validating game files\n\n- Using DDU to uninstall all display drivers then reinstall them\n\nIndex w/ tundra trackers\n\nRyzen 9 5900x, RX 5700XT, 32gb DDR4 3200mhz ram",
